sequenceDiagram
	participant Stream
	participant Guard as Guard pipeline
	participant Ctx as GuardContext
	participant CB as onFinish callback

	Stream->>Guard: chunk / GuardEvent
	Guard->>Ctx: recordViolation / redactions++
	Guard-->>Stream: safe output
	Stream->>Guard: stream end / flush
	Guard->>Ctx: summarizeGuardContext
	Ctx-->>CB: StreamGuardSummary
	Note over CB: violations, countsByRule,<br/>toolsTouched, redactions, mode
